        },
        {
          "text": "Ambila bana ba-Israyeli kuti, Kufumbwa muntu, naba mwaalumi naba mwanakazi, uucita cikonke cakasimpe, cikonke cabu-Naziri, nkokuti cakulisalazizya Jehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
