        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi atuule mugutu, abe cipaizyo cakutontozya Jehova, antoomwe acinzuma cazinkwa zitakwe bumena. Acalo cipaizyo cakwe cabusu, acipaizyo cakwe cakunywa, mupaizi azituule zyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
